  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 — Item-level skip scanning, retry policies with backoff, cron scheduling (RunOnCron), CSV auto-mapping, DI-resolved step components, job-level defaults, EnsureSuccess, OpenTelemetry-ready traces/metrics, auto-reset after successful runs, RFC 4180 quoted CSV parsing, order-independent job builder. Renames: ItemsProcessed→ItemsWritten, ErrorsSkipped→ItemsSkipped, WithToken→WithDelimiter. DbReader/DbWriter moved to NBatch.EntityFrameworkCore; the core package no longer depends on EF Core. See CHANGELOG for the migration guide.",
